    "text": "……いいエピソードだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『可愛いねぇ』って言われて、\r\n『そんなことないです～』って返す小さい冬優子──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごくわかるし、目に浮かぶ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018007020060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "なぁに\r\nさすがにふゆの意思でやってたわけじゃないわよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800702/2018007020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018007020070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『ちゃんとお返事するのよ～』って、\r\n母親の教え",
